  "%IX0.5"|input|"X5 (24V DC Sink/Source, 10kHz)"|di
  "%IX0.6"|input|"X6 (24V DC Sink/Source, 10kHz)"|di
  "%IX0.7"|input|"X7 (24V DC Sink/Source, 10kHz)"|di
